<title>USA: Noland January sales rose 11.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Noland January sales rose 11.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT NEWS, Va. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noland Co said sales totaled $37 million last month, an increase of 11.4 percent from January 1995's $33.2 million total.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
